    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "garden",
        "title": "“With a hoe”",
        "body": [
          "Ekintu ky’okozesa kijja ne **with**: **I dig with a hoe.** **I write with a pen.**",
          "Ekiseera kijja ne **in**: **in the morning**, **in the rainy season**."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "for-someone",
        "title": "Okukolera omuntu",
        "body": [
          "Mu Luganda ekikolwa kikyuka: **ndima → ndimira**, **nfumba → nfumbira**. Mu Lungereza ekikolwa tekikyuka, wabula oyongerako **for** oba **to**: **I dig for Jjajja. I cook for the children. I write to Mother.**"
        ],
        "table": [
          ["Oluganda", "Olungereza"],
          ["ndimira", "I dig for"],
          ["nfumbira", "I cook for"],
          ["ntundira", "I sell at"],
          ["mpandiikira", "I write to"]
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "“Garden” mu Uganda",
        "body": [
          "Mu Lungereza lwa Uganda **garden** kitegeeza ennimiro oba olusuku. Mu Bungereza **garden** kitera okuba ekifo ky’ebimuli okumpi n’ennyumba, ate ennimiro bagiyita **farm** oba **field**."
        ]
      }
